  ],
  "saferAlternatives": [
    "Unlisted tools fall to the other row (Inherit). They include every live ledger, governance, amendment, and reward read; use a decode_* or analyze_* tool on data you already have when no live read is needed.",
    "Read the unsigned JSON from a build_* tool, prepare_transaction, or encode_tx_blob before signing it offline. The server never signs or submits.",
    "Set XAHAU_RPC_URLS or XAHAU_TEST_RPC_URLS to pin live reads to a JSON-RPC node you trust."
